{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：12:00 2026-10-27 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬張晉平民店點餐  《東周刊》獨家直擊視后教女有方  高顏值女兒遺傳神基因\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6c80eb414da24d0720c365711c2ed47b/2026-10/ENT___34.png\"/>\n<p>最新一期《東周刊》獨家直擊現年53歲的「視后」蔡少芬與老公張晉一家五口，連同細仔的朋友一行六人，現身沙田的平民人氣漢堡扒專門店。雖然蔡少芬與張晉坐擁中港兩地逾2億港元的豐厚物業，但私下生活極其貼地。當日戴上黑色Cap帽、素顏上陣的蔡少芬毫無明星架子，親自到自助售賣機為全家點餐，現場更見張晉大病初癒，因此主要都是由老婆負責照顧子女。同行兩位女兒遺傳了父母的優良基因，二女更染了一頭啡金髮，五官精緻，一家人星味極濃，吸引不少途人注目。</p>\n<h2>蔡少芬張晉隔空傳肉盡顯恩愛</h2>\n<p>入座後，蔡少芬與張晉一家人無懼旁人目光，於大長枱低調用餐。席間蔡少芬母愛大發，一邊忙於照顧細仔張樂兒，另一邊廂卻依然心繫大病後的丈夫。兩公婆互相問候，蔡少芬體貼詢問老公：「你夠唔夠飽？」張晉則溫馨回應，並隨即將碟中的漢堡扒分了一半給大呼肚餓的妻子。蔡少芬與張晉結婚18年依然恩愛如昔，兩人在平民餐廳內一個簡單的遞食物小動作，已閃盲全場，足見這對模範夫妻的深厚感情。</p>\n<img alt=\"最新一期《東周刊》獨家直擊現年53歲的「視后」蔡少芬與老公張晉一家五口，連同細仔的朋友一行六人，現身沙田的平民人氣漢堡扒專門店。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cff53d2723797023f8ca39f7921de8d1/2026-10/A.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"雖然蔡少芬與張晉坐擁中港兩地逾2億港元的豐厚物業，但私下生活極其貼地。（《東周刊》圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e382b6057a0ed569f85c81613652e63c/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_5_17_06_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬體貼詢問老公：「你夠唔夠飽？」（《東周刊》圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fbcdfac276ed228c2d2f5d74c2543051/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_5_17_06_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬教導有方女兒獨立有禮。（《東周刊》圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/90ff807f935ede5cf88fb7c93a187376/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_5_17_07_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大女張楚兒在門口不慎倒瀉飲品，她並無慌亂大叫，反而極其淡定地拿出紙巾蹲下抹地，表現獨立。（《東周刊》圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c22f0498f38f0fd8632ad8b3542b6e3/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-26_at_5_17_07_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬與張晉婚後育有兩女一子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/161bf894c920428c4513011be13666dd/2024-05/P1071BE9.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬與老公張晉結婚多年，依舊恩愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38fbd7367e3679308389b12ee89c3380/2022-11/ada_31.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬兩夫婦手持過億元物業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dffab0356c434791552d0b4a9fae822a/2024-05/64e562f7f3975037be3c9c22.jpg\"/>\n<h2>蔡少芬教導有方女兒獨立有禮</h2>\n<p>除了夫妻恩愛，蔡少芬與張晉對仔女的教導亦向來備受讚賞。《東周刊》獨家直擊期間，大女張楚兒在門口不慎倒瀉飲品，她並無慌亂大叫，反而極其淡定地拿出紙巾蹲下抹地，表現獨立；而二女張信兒在用餐期間遞送物件時，亦頻頻禮貌地說「唔該」，可見蔡少芬平日教導有方。這對坐擁2億身家的星級父母，不僅自身生活樸實，連子女也培養得體貼獨立、毫無架子，一家人的貼地教養贏盡坊間口碑。</p>\n<p>想睇最新一期《東周刊》詳細報導，即刻點擊：https://bit.ly/3W5lJMM</p>\n<h2>蔡少芬兩女擁神仙顏值：</h2>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬的兩位千金樣貌越來越標緻，遺傳了媽媽的優良基因。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2411b142135d27c6ea040245f31dbcc0/2025-11/adachoi9800_1763268909_3766894981953814909_6126510906.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬細女張信兒，越大越女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b767e93709fb6953fcc162a2b95594c6/2026-05/001ol3LLgy1hvhcit4fggj61sc2dsnpd02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬與張晉結婚18年，有兩女一子。​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ecdb1ca6c0d0b3d2a75cc112f9228a08/2023-03/ADA_00a.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬與張晉育有兩女一子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26606cde292f4da9fe1ff2fac46dc59e/2022-11/ada_55.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"疫情期間，蔡少芬曾在上海獨自照顧三個仔女一段時間。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6274ff069546cd20192d82c7e69a2eaf/2023-03/ADA_03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬曾分享二女包子小學畢業，獲頒善良證書的喜悅到小紅書。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b8aada11b70779d7baff1dfcfab736ad/2024-06/_3_caishaofen_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬在IG上分享幾張帶細女同孻仔去參加Awana基督教活動的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/67d9ec9aa22de225638f9478856b8bfe/2024-09/Photo_by_Ada_Choi_on_September_05_2024_May_be_a_closeup_of_1_person_child_and_smiling_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬兩母女互相嘟嘴，頭貼頭影合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/04cf2aa49f3e37cd99a949e1fe167829/2024-09/Photo_by_Ada_Choi_on_September_05_2024_May_be_a_selfie_of_3_people_hair_people_kissing_hat_and_text_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬工作再忙也會抽空陪子女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5cab887890852c605a407ee250d99780/2023-03/ADA_04.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬曾一拖三去旅行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7ad3768fd309fdbe6703408404fe911c/2024-04/adachoi9800_1712528840_3341256546528788248_6126510906.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬一拖三去旅行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/592dadc41fa9535c4bda33ef76d2a236/2024-04/adachoi9800_1712528788_3341256108148357328_6126510906.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"兩個女兒似十足媽咪蔡少芬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c34b8aec04e3ea3018baf83a2017c88b/2024-04/adachoi9800_1712528788_3341256108148331928_6126510906.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬兒子越大越似爸爸張晉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9270f09b3a07aea9d0606de19a43dffb/2024-04/adachoi9800_1712528840_3341256546528607123_6126510906.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬曾晒細仔張樂兒為父母洗車的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/32820c7a0932220096e96ae216890087/2024-05/440263819_18277828186206907_8277638939324024016_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬女兒越大越似媽咪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6799d67ac1aec484cfd778c1172a62f1/2024-04/adachoi9800_1712528788_3341256108148431948_6126510906.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬女兒旋風式長大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/54b6836091130a7595ae1a9825858533/2024-04/adachoi9800_1712528640_3341254869033624868_6126510906.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬兩個女小時候極可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/13848d9d885e4018ac585857b33d37db/2025-12/4c0aec55jw1e8p5gsastuj20gl0m841w.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬一家近日在商場被網民捕獲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e85bab9d636983077f2d4991451cbc6e/2025-12/CHOI_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬穿上搶眼的粉紅色運動裝束示人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44a381ce68a4b1ef753c40c20c17d90b/2025-12/CHOI_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張晉妻兒拎住一抽二掕。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/074c05ed86d6c94000c37958f9f1f353/2025-12/CHOI_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬的女兒長得亭亭玉立。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f1d7d1b405adf5a5c30db75375ce6e6/2025-12/CHOI_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬二女的顏值成為焦點。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e4f206b3adc78f0c13563ed18086c75a/2025-12/CHOI_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張晉兩年前拍戲受傷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/457da883fd4765aa7345d9c20b9058fe/2023-04/001nHpg5gy1hct8uc12kmj61o02yox6p02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張晉情況嚴重，休息一段時間。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c0ff4ed00b754edbfd1c4c895255ec64/2023-04/001nHpg5gy1hct9iuh35uj62bc3344qr02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張晉今年4月同蔡少芬及3名子女於國外度假時，突然心臟病發要緊急送院。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4249339ba0d9f54adab58ecab88a7f55/2022-11/ada_21.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張晉出院後立即到香港，於心臟植入支架來解決問題。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/91c0dc20d68eef4dbf06f8b585e3f1e4/2022-11/ada_53.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"張晉一家人未來更珍惜相處時光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/597855f096b7b249fd4212e1dce87108/2025-08/29_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬在IG分享全家到主題公園慶祝的溫馨照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4bee442c7b9ffc160532f116d3aac4d6/2025-11/adachoi9800_1763268909_3766894993194584378_6126510906.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬細仔表情多多。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/08d4e25322c95e079e2f0dd335d97a05/2025-11/adachoi9800_1763268909_3766894997892180220_6126510906.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬兩位千金俘虜網民心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/660248306ef952b97ae03d6069e9dca9/2025-11/adachoi9800_1763268909_3766895002447219896_6126510906.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蔡少芬與張晉亦童心未泯，一時與公園吉祥物合照，一時又搞笑地坐上人力車，由張晉充當車夫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2fb73363326ecbac41df396e5e58e3f3/2025-11/adachoi9800_1763268909_3766895007060962356_6126510906.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小壽星「魚蛋」十分可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b935e41acaa4fefa0252c5dea15eabb5/2025-11/adachoi9800_1763268909_3766895010617753350_6126510906.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T04:22:04.145135+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":689,"images":41,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T04:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T05:38:56.775430+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T04:18:39.937361+00:00","content_hash":"e9b8e3d8996d9e3111dbcf31d6a1a92210cd572258b11f350252b4f9057311e6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}